    <description>Surfaced by the version-mismatch triage of prospecting/community-version-reference.csv. Community's own Miniconda package is stuck at 4.3.21 (published 2017-07-04, 3336 days stale) while the vendor is real at 26.5.3 -- a huge version gap.</description>
